{
  "id": "E300",
  "title": "Let's Go To The Beach",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-02-20",
  "synopsis": "Here are some things you might want to bring to the beach.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/976/7aab75208eabe90a39b49056744729721356c64e.mp3?1549096648",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我们一起去海边吧\n\n丽丽：周末天气很好，我们一起去海边玩吧！\n本：好啊，吹吹海风，喝喝啤酒，一定很舒服！\n丽丽：那我们带什么呢？\n本：泳衣、泳镜、墨镜、书，还有啤酒！",
    "traditional": "我們一起去海邊吧\n\n麗麗：週末天氣很好，我們一起去海邊玩吧！\n本：好啊，吹吹海風，喝喝啤酒，一定很舒服！\n麗麗：那我們帶什麼呢？\n本：泳衣、泳鏡、墨鏡、書，還有啤酒！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Let's Go To The Beach Together"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：周末天气很好，我们一起去海边玩吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：週末天氣很好，我們一起去海邊玩吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zhōu mò tiān qì hěn hǎo wǒ men yì qǐ qù hǎi biān wán ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: This weekend the weather will be really good. Let’s go to the beach to have fun!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：好啊，吹吹海风，喝喝啤酒，一定很舒服！",
      "traditional": "本：好啊，吹吹海風，喝喝啤酒，一定很舒服！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo a chuī chuī hǎi fēng hē hē pí jiǔ yí dìng hěn shū fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Nice! Enjoy the breeze and drink some beer. It will be really relaxing for sure!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那我们带什么呢？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那我們帶什麼呢？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà wǒ men dài shén me ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: So what should we bring?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：泳衣、泳镜、墨镜、书，还有啤酒！",
      "traditional": "本：泳衣、泳鏡、墨鏡、書，還有啤酒！",
      "pinyin": "běn yǒng yī yǒng jìng mò jìng shū hái yǒu pí jiǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Swimwear, swim goggles, sunglasses, books, and beer!"
    }
  ],
